<title>Syria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/syria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-syria-2026-10-26T01:25:38.954Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 26 Oct 2026 01:25:38 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Israeli forces advanced in Quneitra and a Daraa officer was killed while Israeli patrols continue in the region, with directives limiting Syrian security forces from confronting them. Hundreds of Syrians protested repeated Israeli incursions, blocking the Damascus-Suwayda road and demanding detainee releases. Shooting attacks in northern Syria wounded three civilians and a road security officer was martyred in Daraa and later buried. The Syrian foreign minister met Saudi King Hamad, and Damascus hosted the FORTIX 2026 security expo. 2732 battle-related deaths occurred in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxNSC1nQXdzUDZqdGNJdUZhVm5yVlhmRzVGeFlNTk5Ubkc3VmJCV3FjaHdsSEVnRDIta2oxR3VpNWo2LURaYTF1dFBhOGdFbmZEYktoNmZ6cWxLaDM3ZER3M0xkazExTC1uMFRFc1lSUmk5bWNYYmNoQ3kzTXY3bThBaWNpbG9WMFlfVll3eGdtMTdNLUtSUnhINFFkOV9qdkV4UWZmTw?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxOMFUwSG44UDRrWUlUTDY1cUgxSE5ZZUZDZ3FKa3MyRWRPSkpsNklhbF96bFFMdkpzZ2lYTS1WRVN2eE0yWmFkVTY5U1hfZzB4ckpvRXg5dHpLODd4b0RWV3JiQk52czVkUHlpRU9RR2JfZWRyRDJSQ0J0UnIxUWNUYlRwQl9BTU5pS1RsaERKR09fTzVzQWFoaTJUZGZIUUtHRXVEVFJHaW5rUkVjbHF5VXNtQ1dtU2hqUVV6Zg?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Syrian Observer&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiT0FVX3lxTFBXX2R3U2dXMXlNUGN6UVkyRjdYUWJTRENQZGhuTm9va1FWS0JBTHVaLWZ6cUZ2NEpjbElDeWJqTldEWktUNnpxOWJqdFV3WEE?oc=5&quot;&gt;وكالة سبأ&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxPWkhPRGV5aXdCbWNSQkp5dk5iRFZfSUVhVVB0R3BtZ2VGNWltRjItMkFnM0tmTGhSVnhqT2pmdXJjNkdYdDVpSl9OSVpRTkpCaHBidjRHSnkzSlJVdXBuY1h4YnVNZTNsMko5cjZZYjR5eWZHRWRPbFVEdkZLRlpmaFpSak55RXhGbjBRYmk4d2p1YWdRd1NDR0taTU9EZkxuZFBWSmstb2_SAa4BQVVfeXFMT1BxajNxMDB0OHZvS09WVHRZMHNpMTE2X1cxMEhzSWp6WW1QRjUwUzk5MExTZ